<!--
  Four routes is the whole site today. Hand-maintained on purpose: a
  generator for four static files would be more moving parts than the thing
  it generates.

  It stops being hand-maintainable the moment the programmatic pages in
  landing/SEO.md ship, because that is hundreds of URLs built from
  programs.json. Generate it in the same commit that generates them, and
  delete this file rather than leaving a stale copy beside a generated one.

  lastmod is a real signal and a cheap lie. Only move a date when the page's
  content actually changed.
-->
